    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Brood Brothers Auxilia",
    "summary": "A **GENESTEALER CULTS** army using this detachment may include **ASTRA MILITARUM** units even without the **GENESTEALER CULTS** keyword, with a combined points cap by battle size:\n\n- Incursion: 500\n- Strike Force: 1,000\n- Onslaught: 1,500\n\nYour **WARLORD** must be a **GENESTEALER CULTS** model, and **ASTRA MILITARUM** models lose Voice of Command if they have it. This rule cannot bring in units with any of these keywords: **EPIC HERO**, **AIRCRAFT**, **OGRYN**, **RATLING**, **COMMISSAR**, **MINISTORUM PRIEST**, **MILITARUM TEMPESTUS** or **TECH-PRIEST ENGINSEER**.",
